01:08:05.330 --> 01:08:06.570
We still feel lucky now.
直到现在我们依然觉得自己很幸运。

1570
01:08:06.730 --> 01:08:10.150
And we're just so thankful for you guys that listen in every week.
我们非常感谢每周都来收听的各位。

1571
01:08:10.270 --> 01:08:11.310
We love this community.
我们热爱这个社群。

1572
01:08:11.690 --> 01:08:13.850
Jen, I just want to take a quick personal moment.
珍，我只想花一小会儿时间说点个人的事。

1573
01:08:14.110 --> 01:08:19.710
You know, this is our first episode back recording since before the holidays.
你知道，这是我们自节假日以来回归录制的第一集。

1574
01:08:20.330 --> 01:08:23.170
And my family and I got sick over the holidays.
我和家人在假期里生病了。

1575
01:08:23.430 --> 01:08:26.290
We had COVID and it was a scary time.
我们感染了新冠，那段经历挺吓人的。

1576
01:08:26.670 --> 01:08:33.070
You know, the Office Ladies fans were so, so supportive and kind and wrote me messages.
你知道，办公室女士的粉丝们非常非常支持和善良，还给我发了信息。

1577
01:08:33.650 --> 01:08:38.670
The Facebook Office Ladies account did a whole video and I watched it.
办公室女士的脸书账号做了一整段视频，我看了。

1578
01:08:38.790 --> 01:08:39.970
My mom watched it.
我妈妈看了。

1579
01:08:40.150 --> 01:08:41.310
My husband and kids watched it.
我丈夫和孩子们也看了。

1580
01:08:41.390 --> 01:08:44.890
It was very moving for us to see this wonderful community.
看到这个美好的社群，我们都非常感动。

1581
01:08:45.250 --> 01:08:47.150
And it meant so much to me.
这对意义重大。

1582
01:08:47.150 --> 01:08:48.530
I will never forget it.
我永远不会忘记。

1583
01:08:48.750 --> 01:08:50.530
Angela, you shared that video with me.
安吉拉，你把那个视频分享给了我。

1584
01:08:50.710 --> 01:08:52.970
I cried because you're my best friend.
我哭了，因为你是我最好的朋友。

1585
01:08:53.210 --> 01:08:55.790
And I know what that experience was like for you.
而且我知道你当时经历了什么。

1586
01:08:56.030 --> 01:08:59.770
And these loving messages, just the sweetest things.
这些充满爱意的留言，简直是最贴心的问候。

1587
01:08:59.990 --> 01:09:02.170
They just saying like, lady, get better.
它们就在说，女士，快点好起来吧。

1588
01:09:02.410 --> 01:09:05.790
And sending pictures of hummingbirds to try to cheer you up.
还发来蜂鸟的照片试图让你高兴起来。

1589
01:09:05.890 --> 01:09:09.370
It's like, you know, it felt like a group of friends.
这就好像，你知道的，感觉就像是一群朋友。

1590
01:09:09.690 --> 01:09:10.830
Yes, it did.
是的，确实如此。

1591
01:09:11.070 --> 01:09:14.290
Reaching out, sending you just well wishes.
向你伸出援手，送上美好的祝福。

1592
01:09:14.290 --> 01:09:18.950
And I have to say that the intimacy of this community is really real for us, too.
我不得不说，这个社群的亲密感对我们来说也是真情实感的。

1593
01:09:19.370 --> 01:09:22.230
And yeah, thanks for being there for my friend, you guys.
还有，谢谢你们一直陪伴在我的朋友身边。

1594
01:09:22.450 --> 01:09:22.690
Aww.
噢。

1595
01:09:23.710 --> 01:09:25.590
Well, we will be here next week.
好吧，我们下周还会在这里。

1596
01:09:25.670 --> 01:09:27.090
We have a really special episode.
我们有一集非常特别的内容。

1597
01:09:27.290 --> 01:09:32.790
Someone we're so thrilled to talk to, Randall Einhorn, our cinematographer and director from
我们非常高兴能邀请到一位特别嘉宾，兰德尔·艾因霍恩，他是我们《办公室》的摄影指导和导演，

1598
01:09:32.790 --> 01:09:34.990
The Office, is going to be our special gueSt.
将作为我们的特邀嘉宾做客节目。

1599
01:09:34.990 --> 01:09:39.070
And we are going to revisit everything we missed and deep dive with Randall.
我们将重温所有错过的精彩内容，并与兰德尔进行深入探讨。

1600
01:09:39.250 --> 01:09:40.390
We'll see you guys then.
我们到时见。

1601
